{"ticker":"CINF","updated":"2026-10-30T22:40:33Z","profile":{"longName":"Cincinnati Financial Corporation","shortName":"Cincinnati Financial Corporatio","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Insurance - Property & Casualty","country":"United States","website":"https://www.cinfin.com","fullTimeEmployees":5705,"marketCap":27814535168,"trailingPE":10.633216,"forwardPE":19.704588,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.0952568,"pegRatio":2.19,"targetMeanPrice":186.66667,"targetHighPrice":200.0,"targetLowPrice":171.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":6,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":-0.182,"earningsGrowth":-0.584,"grossMargins":0.262,"operatingMargins":0.18542999,"profitMargins":0.20068,"totalRevenue":13274999808,"beta":0.528,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":194.81,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":151.99,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.07},"summary":"Cincinnati Financial Corporation provides property casualty insurance products in the United States. The company operates through five segments: Commercial Lines Insurance, Personal Lines Insurance, Excess and Surplus Lines Insurance, Life Insurance, and Investments. The Commercial Lines Insurance segment offers coverage for commercial casualty and property, commercial auto, and workers' compensation. This segment also provides contract and commercial surety bonds, and fidelity bonds; management liability; and machinery and equipment insurance products. The Personal Lines Insurance segment offers personal auto; homeowner; and other personal lines insurance, such as dwelling fire, inland marine, personal umbrella liability, and watercraft coverages. The Excess and Surplus Lines Insurance segment offers commercial casualty insurance that covers businesses for third-party liability from accidents occurring on their premises or arising out of their operations, such as injuries sustained from products, as well as other coverages comprising miscellaneous errors and omissions, professional liability, and excess liability; and commercial property insurance, which insures buildings, inventory, equipment, and business income from loss or damage due to various causes, such as fire, wind, hail, water, theft, and vandalism. The Life Insurance segment provides term life insurance; universal ","summary_zh":"辛辛那提金融公司在美國提供財產傷亡保險產品。該公司透過五個部門運作：商業保險部門、個人保險部門、超額和盈餘保險部門、人壽保險部門和投資部門。商業保險部門提供商業傷亡和財產、商業汽車和工人賠償的保險。該部門還提供合約和商業擔保債券以及忠誠債券；管理責任；以及機械設備保險產品。個人保險部門提供個人汽車保險；房屋所有者；以及其他個人保險，例如住宅火災保險、內陸海上保險、個人傘責任保險和船舶保險。超額和盈餘保險部門提供商業傷亡保險，涵蓋企業因在其經營場所發生或在運營中發生的事故而承擔的第三方責任，例如產品造成的傷害，以及包括雜項錯誤和遺漏、專業責任和超額責任在內的其他保險；商業財產保險，為建築物、庫存、設備和營業收入因火災、風、冰雹、水、盜竊和損失等各種保險而造成的損失或損害保險等。人壽保險部門提供定期人壽保險；普遍的","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"保險 - 財產與意外傷害","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":153.09,"h":153.48,"l":151.96,"c":152.95,"v":399600},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":152.05,"h":153.7,"l":152.05,"c":153.53,"v":280200},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":154.5,"h":155.63,"l":154.45,"c":155.59,"v":229100},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":155.78,"h":155.97,"l":152.38,"c":153.36,"v":333300},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":153.42,"h":153.58,"l":151.54,"c":153.46,"v":345100},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":153.07,"h":154.78,"l":153.07,"c":153.69,"v":408000},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":152.33,"h":152.95,"l":151.22,"c":152.31,"v":443100},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":152.51,"h":156.9,"l":152.18,"c":156.76,"v":395300},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":156.36,"h":157.67,"l":156.14,"c":156.86,"v":613700},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":157.15,"h":157.65,"l":154.65,"c":155.13,"v":515900},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":154.69,"h":154.7,"l":153.1,"c":153.27,"v":434700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":153.05,"h":156.36,"l":152.98,"c":154.48,"v":405900},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":153.66,"h":156.1,"l":153.66,"c":155.93,"v":426100},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":156.48,"h":156.89,"l":154.27,"c":156.11,"v":1123200},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":154.47,"h":155.51,"l":153.91,"c":154.69,"v":357900},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":154.05,"h":156.03,"l":154.05,"c":154.44,"v":302800},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":154.53,"h":155.23,"l":154.01,"c":154.52,"v":337600},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":154.83,"h":156.57,