ZbWxBbTF2T0FPS3AwWUdfOXpObVZGZHgtWEFiaUFkU012bXZnZEtKMFQxUkhDUlZoa0ZVUXpuZnlfQVpOVml3MG5ibTd4YTNFQlM1SlMtX2t6VXVoSGNWcG5LUElLenVxWXhzalktWmFROGJHLUVMVDVQcDNvVHBqeWxsWEVwSE9ROTRSOGJQZ0w0ZWlWQy1zRGNZeGUyUDdoYWktemxHdGVWbUljaXc2VW5SUQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-26","zh":"辛辛那提金融公司（納斯達克股票代碼：CINF）2026 年第三季銷售額超出預期"}],"order_news":[{"title":"CINF Q3 FY2026 earnings call","src":"finance.biggo.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTE96M1pObEstdUI4ZjJsaDZjUC1ZUkJOMVE4MHVSdHZpQWNpWkFWc1J2WkNDS3gyU2NEQmY4QUQ1dXh4TVF3WmZidXI4N0JteUJDeWIzcWZONzBqbGdROUh2OWthdUtURm1sWVpSbW0zdUJsNDAzdmV4dA?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":"CINF 2026 財年第三季財報電話會議"},{"title":"Guidewire to Buy London's hyperexponential for $1.7 Billion, Betting on AI Underwriting","src":"BigGo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE4zOUtFMFBqQzFfX3ZuWFlCX0hUaDhMaWVKV21tZkxfVXRITE5hdnUyQjFaWXd6S3BJZVY0dTRqQXZTUHZVQjI1a1VKVXd0ZXhMU1plSklnNXdxOGtzRXcyYkRlRnN0d0JZS1VkLUZpWmJjSm5yOHc?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":""}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":4},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-23","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/20286/000002028626000008/cinf-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"We are an Ohio corporation formed in 1968. Our lead subsidiary, The Cincinnati Insurance Company, was founded in 1950. Our main business is property casualty insurance marketed through independent insurance agencies in 46 states. Our headquarters is in Fairfield, Ohio.","zh":"我們是一家成立於 1968 年的俄亥俄州公司。我們的主要子公司辛辛那提保險公司成立於 1950 年。我們的主要業務是透過獨立保險機構在 46 個州銷售財產傷亡保險。我們的總部位於俄亥俄州費爾菲爾德。"},{"en":"Cincinnati Financial Corporation owns 100% of four subsidiaries: The Cincinnati Insurance Company (Cincinnati Insurance), Cincinnati Global Underwriting Ltd.SM (Cincinnati Global), CSU Producer Resources Inc. and CFC Investment Company. In addition, the parent company has an investment portfolio, owns the headquarters property and is responsible for corporate borrowings and shareholder dividends.","zh":"辛辛那提金融公司擁有四家子公司 100% 的股權：辛辛那提保險公司 (Cincinnati Insurance)、辛辛那提全球保險有限公司 (Cincinnati Global)、CSU Producer Resources Inc. 和 CFC Investment Company。此外，母公司擁有投資組合，擁有總部財產，並負責公司借款和股東股利。"},{"en":"The Cincinnati Insurance Company owns 100% of four additional insurance subsidiaries. Our standard market property casualty insurance group includes two of those subsidiaries – The Cincinnati Casualty Company and The Cincinnati Indemnity Company. This group writes a broad range of business, homeowner and auto policies. The Cincinnati Insurance Company also conducts the business of our reinsurance assumed operations, known as Cincinnati Re . Other subsidiaries of The Cincinnati Insurance Company include: The Cincinnati Life Insurance Company (Cincinnati Life), which provides life insurance policies and fixed annuities; and The Cincinnati Specialty Underwriters Insurance Company (Cincinnati Specialty Underwriters), which offers excess and surplus lines insurance products. In this report and elsewhere we often refer to any or all of these five companies as The Cincinnati Insurance Companies","zh":"辛辛那提保險公司擁有另外四家保險子公司的 100% 股權。我們的標準市場財產傷亡保險集團包括其中兩家子公司—辛辛那提傷亡公司和辛辛那提賠償公司。該小組撰寫廣泛的商業、房主和汽車保單。辛辛那提保險公司也開展我們的再保險承擔業務（稱為辛辛那提再保險公司）。辛辛那提保險公司的其他子公司包括： 辛辛那提人壽保險公司（Cincinnati Life），提供人壽保險單和固定年金；辛辛那提專業保險商保險公司（Cincinnati Specialty Underwriters），提供超額保險和盈餘保險產品。在本報告和其他地方，我們經常將這五家公司中的任何一家或全部稱為辛辛那提保險公司"}],"markets":[{"en":"Consolidated financial results primarily reflect the results of our five reporting segments. These segments are defined based on financial information we use to evaluate performance and to determine the allocation of assets.","zh":"合併財務表現主要反映我們五個報告分部的表現。這些細分市場是根據我們用來評估績效和確定資產分配的財務資訊來定義的。"},{"en":"Revenues, income before income taxes and identifiable assets for each segment are shown in Item 8, Note 18 of the Consolidated Financial Statements. Some of that information is discussed in this section, where we explain the business operations of each segment. The financial performance of each segment is discussed in Item 7, Management's Discussion and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations.","zh":"各分部的收入、所得稅前收入及可辨認資產列於合併財務報表附註18第8項。本節討論其中一些資訊，並解釋每個部門的業務運作。每個分部的財務表現在第 7 項「管理階層對財務狀況及經營績效的討論與分析」中討論。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Commercial Lines Insurance","val":4868000000,"zh":"商業保險"},{"name":"Personal Lines Insurance","val":3204000000,"zh":"個人保險"},{"name":"Investment Segment Of CINF","val":2607000000,"zh":"CINF投資部門"},{"name":"Excessand Surplus Lines Insurance","val":702000000,"zh":"超額盈餘保險"},{"name":"Life Insurance","val":336000000,"zh":"人壽保險"}],"total":12631000000}},"peers":["DOV","GPC","BEN","CB","GWW"]}}